# Trip Preferences

## Trip Basics

- **Destination**: [City, Country — e.g., Tokyo, Japan]
- **Dates**: YYYY-MM-DD to YYYY-MM-DD
- **Duration**: N days
- **Party size**: N people
- **Home base**: [Hotel/Airbnb name and neighborhood]

## Daily Schedule

- **Earliest start**: 08:00
- **Latest end**: 22:00
- **Pace**: Packed / Moderate / Leisurely

## Food & Drink

### Category Targets

List each food/drink category and how many times you want it across the trip:

| Category | Target | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| Coffee | daily | Morning and/or afternoon |
| [e.g., Ramen] | 3–4x | Vary styles |
| [e.g., Sushi] | 1–2x | At least one omakase |

### Must-Haves

Dishes or food experiences that MUST appear somewhere in the trip:
- [e.g., "At least one wagyu dinner"]

### Avoid / Restrictions

- [e.g., No shellfish]

### Shopping

Only schedule shopping for: [e.g., stationery, books, electronics — no clothing/fashion]

