Rate each type: **must-do** / **want-to** / **nice-to-have** / **skip**

| Type | Priority |
|---|---|
| Temples & shrines | |
| Markets & food halls | |
| Museums & galleries | |
| Gardens & parks | |
| Nightlife | |
| [Add your own] | |

## Fixed Events

Pre-booked activities or events that must land on specific dates:

| Date | Event | Time | Notes |
|---|---|---|---|
| YYYY-MM-DD | [Event name] | HH:MM | |

## Special Planning Rules

Any specific constraints for the planner:
- [e.g., "One big group dinner — plan for bar-hopping, not a single venue"]
- [e.g., "Never schedule an early start the day after a late night"]
- [e.g., "Offer a midday break back at the home base when geography allows"]
